  "reasoning": "The payer has issued a CO-18 denial, which explicitly states the claim was already adjudicated and paid; resubmitting is prohibited and would be a process mistake. Since the payer has already paid the allowed amount, the remaining open balance represents the patient's contractual responsibility (deductible and coinsurance). The most appropriate and compliant action is to bill the patient for their share of the cost.",
